OL,3,APolice investigate car crash into house
OL,4,Ain Glasgow suburb
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a car
OL,7,Fcrashed into a house in a Glasgow
OL,8,Fsuburb.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the property on
OL,11,FLow Borland Way in Eaglesham, East
OL,12,FRenfrewshire, at about 13:20 on Friday.
OL,14,FA large police presence was seen on the
OL,15,Fstreet on Friday, which was sealed off
OL,16,Fbehind a cordon. The house was
OL,17,Fprotected by temporary fencing on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
