OL,3,APolice investigate car crash into house
OL,4,Ain Glasgow suburb
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Scotland News understands that
OL,7,FPolice Scotland is not ruling out links
OL,8,Fto Operation Portaledge - its
OL,9,Finvestigation into gangland activity
OL,10,Facross central Scotland.
